  "reference": "Original Multimodal Training visual gold standard",
  "hero": "<section class=\"fs2-hero\"><span class=\"fs2-kicker\">SELECTIVE SIGNAL · MACHINE LEARNING INPUTS</span><h2>Keep the features that help prediction.</h2><p>Discover how feature selection removes noisy or repeated inputs, chooses useful originals, and avoids leaking validation information.</p><div class=\"fs2-canvas\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 940 365\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A collection of six candidate input columns passes through a feature selection funnel, leaving three retained original features\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"938\" height=\"363\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#fcfeff\" stroke=\"#dae7ed\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"43\" fill=\"#477DB2\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">ORIGINAL FEATURE SPACE</text><rect x=\"39\" y=\"65\" width=\"280\" height=\"235\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#E9F4FB\" stroke=\"#bdd9e7\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"58\" y=\"99\" width=\"31\" height=\"132\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d2e2e9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"61\" y=\"226\" width=\"25\" height=\"3\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"72\" y=\"255\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">1</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"99\" width=\"31\" height=\"132\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d2e2e9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"103\" y=\"200\" width=\"25\" height=\"29\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"114\" y=\"255\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">2</text><rect x=\"142\" y=\"99\" width=\"31\" height=\"132\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d2e2e9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"145\" y=\"174\" width=\"25\" height=\"55\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#D49D48\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"255\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">3</text><rect x=\"184\" y=\"99\" width=\"31\" height=\"132\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d2e2e9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"187\" y=\"226\" width=\"25\" height=\"3\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"198\" y=\"255\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">4</text><rect x=\"226\" y=\"99\" width=\"31\" height=\"132\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d2e2e9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"229\" y=\"200\" width=\"25\" height=\"29\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"255\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">5</text><rect x=\"268\" y=\"99\" width=\"31\" height=\"132\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d2e2e9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"271\" y=\"174\" width=\"25\" height=\"55\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"282\" y=\"255\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">6</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"281\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Six candidate input columns</text><rect x=\"408\" y=\"101\" width=\"171\" height=\"165\" rx=\"25\" fill=\"#E2F4EE\" stroke=\"#b6d9ca\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"493\" y=\"148\" fill=\"#177C70\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">SELECT</text><path d=\"M436 165L549 165L511 215L473 215Z\" stroke=\"#177C70\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<text x=\"493\" y=\"246\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">keep useful</text><rect x=\"656\" y=\"65\" width=\"243\" height=\"235\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#F0EDFA\" stroke=\"#d0c6e8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"678\" y=\"102\" fill=\"#7965AD\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">SELECTED INPUTS</text><rect x=\"683\" y=\"137\" width=\"53\" height=\"102\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d5cfec\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"752\" y=\"137\" width=\"53\" height=\"102\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d5cfec\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"822\" y=\"137\" width=\"53\" height=\"102\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d5cfec\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>undefined<text x=\"780\" y=\"277\" fill=\"#7965AD\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Original values stay</text><path d=\"M322 178L402 178\" stroke=\"#177C70\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<path d=\"M391.4690092573155 183.75310646325045L402 178L391.4690092573155 172.24689353674955\" stroke=\"#177C70\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<path d=\"M585 178L653 178\" stroke=\"#7965AD\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<path d=\"M642.4690092573155 183.75310646325045L653 178L642.4690092573155 172.24689353674955\" stroke=\"#7965AD\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<rect x=\"302\" y=\"315\" width=\"333\" height=\"34\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#E2F4EE\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"468.5\" y=\"338\" fill=\"#177C70\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Select columns; do not invent new ones</text></svg></div><div class=\"fs2-mini\"><span>Keep original columns</span><span>Measure relevance</span><span>Validate without leakage</span></div></section>",
