    {
      "questionNumber": 1,
      "html": "<section class=\"fs2-fig\"><span class=\"fs2-kicker\">VISUAL 01 · FEATURE SELECTION</span><h3>Rank features by useful prediction signal</h3><div class=\"fs2-canvas\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 940 365\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustrative hotel cancellation feature scores retain previous cancellations, lead time and booking channel ahead of unrelated identifiers\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"938\" height=\"363\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#fcfeff\" stroke=\"#dae7ed\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"37\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">PREDICTING HOTEL CANCELLATIONS</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"85\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Example candidate features</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"128\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Previous cancellations</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"109\" width=\"425\" height=\"23\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#E9F4FB\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"109\" width=\"386.75\" height=\"23\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"755\" y=\"128\" fill=\"#177C70\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">91 / 100</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"175\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Days before arrival</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"156\" width=\"425\" height=\"23\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#E9F4FB\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"156\" width=\"335.75\" height=\"23\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"755\" y=\"175\" fill=\"#477DB2\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">79 / 100</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"222\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Booking channel</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"203\" width=\"425\" height=\"23\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#E9F4FB\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"203\" width=\"229.50000000000003\" height=\"23\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#D49D48\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"755\" y=\"222\" fill=\"#D49D48\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">54 / 100</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"269\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Random reference ID</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"250\" width=\"425\" height=\"23\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#E9F4FB\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"250\" width=\"25.5\" height=\"23\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"755\" y=\"269\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">6 / 100</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"316\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Unrelated row order</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"297\" width=\"425\" height=\"23\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#E9F4FB\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"297\" width=\"12.75\" height=\"23\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"755\" y=\"316\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">3 / 100</text><path d=\"M300 253H809\" stroke=\"#D16F5F\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 6\"/<text x=\"824\" y=\"270\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">DROP</text><rect x=\"277\" y=\"328\" width=\"407\" height=\"34\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#FFF2DF\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"480.5\" y=\"351\" fill=\"#946927\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Illustrative scores, not universal importance</text></svg></div><p class=\"fs2-note\">Relevance is tied to a prediction target and must be estimated on training data.</p></section>"
    },
    {
      "questionNumber": 2,
      "html": "<section class=\"fs2-fig\"><span class=\"fs2-kicker\">VISUAL 02 · FEATURE SELECTION</span><h3>Noise versus duplicated evidence</h3><div class=\"fs2-canvas\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 940 365\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"One scatter graph has unrelated points; a second contains two almost identical signals that repeat information\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"938\" height=\"363\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#fcfeff\" stroke=\"#dae7ed\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"43\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">TWO WAYS INPUTS BECOME UNHELPFUL</text><rect x=\"39\" y=\"73\" width=\"421\" height=\"243\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#E9F4FB\" stroke=\"#c0d9e6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"110\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">IRRELEVANT = NOISE</text><path d=\"M83 268H414M83 268V136\" stroke=\"#C7D8E4\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<circle cx=\"101\" cy=\"153\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"182\" cy=\"206\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"263\" cy=\"155\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"344\" cy=\"208\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"101\" cy=\"157\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"182\" cy=\"210\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"263\" cy=\"159\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"344\" cy=\"212\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"101\" cy=\"161\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"182\" cy=\"214\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"263\" cy=\"163\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"344\" cy=\"216\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"101\" cy=\"165\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"182\" cy=\"218\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"263\" cy=\"167\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"344\" cy=\"220\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"302\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"720\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">No stable relation to the target</text><rect x=\"487\" y=\"73\" width=\"415\" height=\"243\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#E2F4EE\" stroke=\"#b7dacf\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"517\" y=\"110\" fill=\"#177C70\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">REDUNDANT = REPEATED</text><path d=\"M533 261H851M533 261V136\" stroke=\"#C7D8E4\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<path d=\"M565 251L623 215L681 183L736 155L804 130\" stroke=\"#177C70\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<path d=\"M565 245L623 208L681 176L736 148L804 123\" stroke=\"#D49D48\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<text x=\"553\" y=\"299\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Two similar signals, extra complexity</text></svg></div><p class=\"fs2-note\">Irrelevant features add noise; redundant features can repeat information and increase complexity.</p></section>"
    },
