      "questionNumber": 4,
      "html": "<section class=\"fs2-fig\"><span class=\"fs2-kicker\">VISUAL 04 · FEATURE SELECTION</span><h3>Filter, wrapper, embedded: when to decide</h3><div class=\"fs2-canvas\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 940 365\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Three panels show statistical ranking, evaluation of alternate subsets, and coefficients learned during model fitting\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"938\" height=\"363\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#fcfeff\" stroke=\"#dae7ed\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"39\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">THREE DIFFERENT DECISION SYSTEMS</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"76\" width=\"265\" height=\"237\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#E9F4FB\" stroke=\"#bcd8e7\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"172\" y=\"112\" fill=\"#477DB2\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">FILTER</text><text x=\"172\" y=\"143\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"710\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Score columns first</text><rect x=\"341\" y=\"76\" width=\"265\" height=\"237\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#FFF2DF\" stroke=\"#efd8ae\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"473\" y=\"112\" fill=\"#D49D48\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">WRAPPER</text><text x=\"473\" y=\"143\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"710\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Test feature subsets</text><rect x=\"642\" y=\"76\" width=\"265\" height=\"237\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#E2F4EE\" stroke=\"#b0d6c8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"774\" y=\"112\" fill=\"#177C70\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">EMBEDDED</text><text x=\"774\" y=\"143\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"710\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Select while fitting</text><rect x=\"66\" y=\"235\" width=\"37\" height=\"36\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"116\" y=\"212\" width=\"37\" height=\"59\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"166\" y=\"182\" width=\"37\" height=\"89\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"215\" y=\"247\" width=\"37\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"173\" y=\"295\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"740\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Statistical ranking</text><rect x=\"372\" y=\"176\" width=\"74\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"456\" y=\"176\" width=\"74\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"540\" y=\"176\" width=\"74\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"208\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">A+B</text><text x=\"493\" y=\"208\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">A+C</text><text x=\"577\" y=\"208\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">B+C</text><rect x=\"370\" y=\"267\" width=\"235\" height=\"34\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"487.5\" y=\"290\" fill=\"#D49D48\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Compare model scores</text><path d=\"M688 265H862M688 265V167\" stroke=\"#C7D8E4\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<rect x=\"716\" y=\"199\" width=\"32\" height=\"66\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"771\" y=\"238\" width=\"32\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"826\" y=\"168\" width=\"32\" height=\"97\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"775\" y=\"294\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"740\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Coefficients decide</text></svg></div><p class=\"fs2-note\">Filters use scores; wrappers repeatedly evaluate subsets; embedded methods choose during estimator fitting.</p></section>"
    },
    {
      "questionNumber": 5,
      "html": "<section class=\"fs2-fig\"><span class=\"fs2-kicker\">VISUAL 05 · FEATURE SELECTION</span><h3>Three ways to identify relevant features</h3><div class=\"fs2-canvas\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 940 365\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mutual information detects dependence, RFE progressively removes ranked features, and L1 may zero out coefficients\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"938\" height=\"363\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#fcfeff\" stroke=\"#dae7ed\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"43\" fill=\"#477DB2\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">MI</text><text x=\"358\" y=\"43\" fill=\"#D49D48\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">RFE</text><text x=\"678\" y=\"43\" fill=\"#177C70\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">L1 REGULARIZATION</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"66\" width=\"230\" height=\"256\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#E9F4FB\" stroke=\"#d2e0e2\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"356\" y=\"66\" width=\"230\" height=\"256\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#FFF2DF\" stroke=\"#d2e0e2\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"671\" y=\"66\" width=\"230\" height=\"256\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#E2F4EE\" stroke=\"#d2e0e2\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M67 270H242M67 270V103\" stroke=\"#C7D8E4\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"220\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7965AD\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"214.27280128266048\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"106\" cy=\"198.4032373365578\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7965AD\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"117\" cy=\"176.02683401276616\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"152.2697556478732\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7965AD\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"139\" cy=\"132.57446259144496\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"121.4529091286974\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7965AD\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"161\" cy=\"121.4529091286974\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"172\" cy=\"132.57446259144496\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7965AD\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"183\" cy=\"152.2697556478732\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"194\" cy=\"176.02683401276616\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7965AD\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"198.40323733655777\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"216\" cy=\"214.2728012826605\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7965AD\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"227\" cy=\"220\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#477DB2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"155\" y=\"300\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"720\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Nonlinear link</text><rect x=\"388\" y=\"118\" width=\"158\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#D49D48\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"407\" y=\"169\" width=\"120\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#D49D48\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"426\" y=\"220\" width=\"83\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#D49D48\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"478\" y=\"146\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">8 features</text><text x=\"467\" y=\"197\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">5 features</text><text x=\"469\" y=\"247\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">3 kept</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"302\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"720\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Remove, refit, repeat</text><path d=\"M701 260H875M701 260V119\" stroke=\"#C7D8E4\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<rect x=\"726\" y=\"164\" width=\"31\" height=\"96\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"779\" y=\"217\" width=\"31\" height=\"43\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"832\" y=\"259\" width=\"31\" height=\"1\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"786\" y=\"304\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"720\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Some weights → zero</text></svg></div><p class=\"fs2-note\">MI is a dependency score, RFE is a wrapper search, and L1 adds sparsity to fitting.</p></section>"
    },
    {
      "questionNumber": 6,
      "html": "<section class=\"fs2-fig\"><span class=\"fs2-kicker\">VISUAL 06 · FEATURE SELECTION</span><h3>Feature selection belongs inside each fold</h3><div class=\"fs2-canvas\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 940 365\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Selecting using all data before cross-validation contaminates validation; selecting only within each training fold keeps the boundary\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"938\" height=\"363\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#fcfeff\" stroke=\"#dae7ed\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">THE WRONG ORDER</text><text x=\"506\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#177C70\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">THE RIGHT ORDER</text><rect x=\"39\" y=\"75\" width=\"407\" height=\"243\" rx=\"19\" fill=\"#FFF0EA\" stroke=\"#ecc5c0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"491\" y=\"75\" width=\"412\" height=\"243\" rx=\"19\" fill=\"#E2F4EE\" stroke=\"#b4dacc\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"66\" y=\"119\" width=\"344\" height=\"62\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e6beba\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"238\" y=\"156\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Select on ALL data</text><path d=\"M238 186L238 219\" stroke=\"#D16F5F\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<path d=\"M232.24689353674955 208.46900925731552L238 219L243.75310646325045 208.46900925731552\" stroke=\"#D16F5F\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<rect x=\"84\" y=\"226\" width=\"311\" height=\"61\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"#fbe0dc\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"239\" y=\"263\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Validation affected</text><rect x=\"521\" y=\"115\" width=\"350\" height=\"68\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#b6dacc\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"697\" y=\"153\" fill=\"#177C70\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Split into CV folds first</text><path d=\"M703 185L703 214\" stroke=\"#177C70\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<path d=\"M697.2468935367496 203.46900925731552L703 214L708.7531064632504 203.46900925731552\" stroke=\"#177C70\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<rect x=\"522\" y=\"220\" width=\"350\" height=\"70\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#b6dacc\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"697\" y=\"248\" fill=\"#177C70\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Select inside train fold</text><text x=\"697\" y=\"272\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Score held-out fold</text></svg></div><p class=\"fs2-note\">Fit feature selectors separately for every cross-validation training fold.</p></section>"
    },
    {
      "questionNumber": 7,
      "html": "<section class=\"fs2-fig\"><span class=\"fs2-kicker\">VISUAL 07 · FEATURE SELECTION</span><h3>Stability, accuracy, and time all matter</h3><div class=\"fs2-canvas\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 940 365\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Heatmap compares feature selection across resamples, and a score versus computational cost plot shows competing trade-offs\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"938\" height=\"363\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#fcfeff\" stroke=\"#dae7ed\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"43\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">STABILITY ACROSS FIVE RESAMPLES</text><text x=\"552\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"900\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">PREDICTION VS COMPUTE COST</text><rect x=\"38\" y=\"72\" width=\"470\" height=\"264\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#E9F4FB\" stroke=\"#c4dce7\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"540\" y=\"72\" width=\"363\" height=\"264\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#E2F4EE\" stroke=\"#bad9cd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"61\" y=\"120\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"760\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Lead time</text><rect x=\"249\" y=\"101\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"295\" y=\"101\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"341\" y=\"101\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"387\" y=\"101\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"433\" y=\"101\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"61\" y=\"159\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"760\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">History</text><rect x=\"249\" y=\"140\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"295\" y=\"140\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"341\" y=\"140\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"387\" y=\"140\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dbe7ea\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"433\" y=\"140\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"61\" y=\"198\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"760\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Price</text><rect x=\"249\" y=\"179\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"295\" y=\"179\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dbe7ea\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"341\" y=\"179\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"387\" y=\"179\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dbe7ea\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"433\" y=\"179\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"61\" y=\"237\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"760\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Channel</text><rect x=\"249\" y=\"218\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dbe7ea\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"295\" y=\"218\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"341\" y=\"218\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dbe7ea\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"387\" y=\"218\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dbe7ea\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"433\" y=\"218\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dbe7ea\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"61\" y=\"276\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"760\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Random ID</text><rect x=\"249\" y=\"257\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dbe7ea\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"295\" y=\"257\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dbe7ea\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"341\" y=\"257\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dbe7ea\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"387\" y=\"257\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dbe7ea\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"433\" y=\"257\" width=\"37\" height=\"27\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dbe7ea\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"318\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"750\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Repeated selection is one stability signal</text><path d=\"M585 284H873M585 284V126\" stroke=\"#C7D8E4\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/<text x=\"871\" y=\"309\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"730\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Cost →</text><text x=\"562\" y=\"120\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"730\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">↑ Score</text><circle cx=\"625\" cy=\"243\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"637\" y=\"232\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">A</text><circle cx=\"676\" cy=\"199\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"688\" y=\"188\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">B</text><circle cx=\"741\" cy=\"165\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"753\" y=\"154\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">C</text><circle cx=\"810\" cy=\"173\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#D16F5F\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"822\" y=\"162\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">D</text><circle cx=\"854\" cy=\"162\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#177C70\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"866\" y=\"151\" fill=\"#233D56\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">E</text><path d=\"M620 257Q672 208 735 167\" stroke=\"#177C70\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/<text x=\"722\" y=\"330\" fill=\"#5B7188\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Choose a useful trade-off, not just size</text></svg></div><p class=\"fs2-note\">A selected subset must be both useful on unseen data and reasonably stable and efficient.</p></section>"
